//    symbols, durations) and Table 2 (voicing classes):
//    https://redcedar.com/sc01/sc01.pdf
//  - Votrax "Phonetic Speech Dictionary for the SC-01" (1981), Tables 1, 2:
//    https://downloads.reactivemicro.com/Electronics/Speech/SC-01%20Dictionary.pdf
//  - D. H. Klatt, "Software for a cascade/parallel formant synthesizer",
